What:           /sys/devices/platform/10203000.iommu/state
Date:           October 2026
Contact:        FuQuan233
Description:
                Read-only last domain configuration flag and cached TTBR,
                cumulative mapped/unmapped bytes, error IRQ count and
                range TLB invalidation timeouts for MT6580 M4U. Mapping
                totals include freed and live buffers; they do not measure
                instantaneous DMA traffic. Counters are individually sampled.
                Reading does not access powered-off device registers.

What:           /sys/devices/platform/14016000.larb/context
Date:           October 2026
Contact:        FuQuan233
Description:
                Read-only LARB0 context-valid flag, save/restore and busy
                counters, last requested MMU bitmap and programmed readback.
                The latter is a cached value, not a live register access.

What:           /sys/devices/platform/14017000.smi/context
Date:           October 2026
Contact:        FuQuan233
Description:
                Read-only SMI COMMON context-valid flag and save/restore
                counters. Reading does not power on the DISP domain.
